    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SACRAMENTO\nMETROPOLITAN AIRPORT",
      "SACRAMENTO METROPOLITAN AIRPORT (SMF)\nNorthern California's newest commercial airport was opened during October,\n1967, and was specifically designed to accommodate the jet-age aircraft. Owned\nand operated by the County of Sacramento, this facility is equipped with the\nlatest in air navigational and traffic control aids including the 173 foot FAA\ncontrol ad\nPub. by Vija Berry. Realty Air Photos Sacramento, Ca. 95822\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\n:....:\nPost Card\n80452-C\nWEST NTACK, NEW TORX"
